This is a derivative of nvidia/Gemma-4-26B-A4B-NVFP4, the NVIDIA
ModelOpt NVFP4 quantization of Google's gemma-4-26B-A4B-it.
The modification published here: tie_word_embeddings is disabled and a
separately NVFP4-quantized lm_head.weight is added.

